WEBVTT

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.980
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:23.470
In that case, I can't be with you anymore.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:27.060
The diamond gemstones are all of you!

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.470
What do you mean "this thing", you fool!

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.170
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

