<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:34.830
CHAPTER 13

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:39.710
DIAMONDS OF GREED! WANYUDO'S TRAP

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:45.360
Did you hear?

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:47.400
It opened in front of the station.

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:51.240
I know! All-You-Can-Bag
super cheap diamonds!

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:54.390
I checked it out yesterday. Here, for you!

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:58.600
A ring, a necklace, and even earrings!
Thank you!

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:03.050
According to an appraiser,
their quality is guaranteed.

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:06.670
Oh, so you're interested, Catchick?

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:09.300
I guess you're a girl after all.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.890
What's that supposed to mean?

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:17.180
Seriously, I don't think gender matters in
thinking whether jewels are pretty or not.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:20.900
True. Even I can appreciate what's pretty.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:24.230
Though, when it comes down to it,
they're just rocks.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:26.480
And they're not romantic either.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.490
What, Kitaro, is it heavy?

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:35.990
I told you I'd carry them.
It's my shopping after all.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:39.000
Super cheap diamonds, huh?

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.000
Huh?

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.540
Is something wrong?

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:47.230
Oh, I was just thinking that something
too good to be true must have a catch.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.960
Hmm. A catch, huh?

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.980
Are you okay?

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:03.940
I didn't need you to protect me...

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:07.090
What reckless driving!

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.550
Hey! We had a green light!

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:22.670
Sorry, sorry. If it isn't Kitaro-kun,
lady Catchick, and Daddy Eyeball-sama.

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:23.960
Daddy Eyeball-sama?

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.170
How creepy!

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.460
Kitaro, you're hurt!

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:29.800
It's a scratch.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:32.470
A scratch? That's no good.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:36.930
You should be admitted to a premium
private room in a top hospital right away.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:40.180
Here, for the medical bill.
Go ahead and take it.

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:46.060
You made some easy money with
some dirty scheme again, didn't you?

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:51.280
Hey, don't be rude! I'm making money
because my customers are satisfied.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:54.740
It's philanthropy. Social contribution.

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:59.810
Kitaro, as my buddy,
do you want in on this?

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:08.380
You can replace that hovel in the
GeGeGe Forest with a mansion in no time.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:09.460
Rat Man.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:10.960
Oh? You in?

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.510
What are you up to?

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:14.490
Huh?

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:18.970
Why do I sense <i>yokai</i> activity
from the diamond on that ring?

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:20.470
Huh? Huh?

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:27.170
I-If you're not in, I can't tell you...

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:32.030
You're not trying to
get humans involved, are you?

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:33.320
Gulp!

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.720
I-I said I can't tell you.

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:37.450
Answer me!

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:40.070
Are you hurting people again?

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:54.150
Uh, wait. Since when have you been
an ally of the humans?

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:58.300
Every time I see you,
you talk all arrogant and noble,

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:02.780
but you just pick on scoundrels
so the humans will reward you, don't you?

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:05.480
I'm not like you!

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:08.310
I'm not looking for anything like that!

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:12.780
Listen, I'm a half-<i>yokai</i> born between
a human and a <i>yokai</i>.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.990
I know all about <i>yokai</i> and humans,
forwards and backwards.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.450
That's why I know.

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.870
Because of guys like me,

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:23.120
you get to act like a <i>yokai</i> leader
and play nice with the humans!

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:26.080
Do you really mean that?

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.830
In that case, I can't be with you anymore.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:36.840
That's right. I'm not like you.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:43.850
I'm a piece of trash
to both <i>yokai</i> and humans.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.560
Ghost Tribe descendant or whatever,

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:49.670
I'm not always surrounded
by friends like you.

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:53.110
I've always been on my own.

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:56.530
Kitaro, we've known each other
for a pretty long time.

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.940
We're through. Bye!

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:11.880
Luck's finally come my way so I invite him
and he lectures me with that sullen face.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:14.520
Glad I cut ties with him.

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:20.680
We are currently limiting entry.
We apologize for the inconvenience.

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:23.470
We are currently limiting entry.

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:28.270
Thank you for coming
to BiBiBi Carat Diamond today.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:31.520
Today, All-You-Can-Bag diamonds
for one million yen!

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:33.480
High quality diamonds
for only one million yen!

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:37.440
-Diamonds! Diamonds!
-Please take this opportunity!

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.440
Diamonds! Diamonds!

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:43.080
Excuse me! You're running out of diamonds!

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.700
Replenish them already!

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.330
Yes, right away!

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.160
Sir, this is the last of them.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:49.250
Oh, I see.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.540
Hurry up!

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.380
Yes! I'm coming!

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:54.120
Here, a million yen.

00:07:58.070 --> 00:07:59.680
Looks like business is good.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:02.430
Yes. Sales are booming as usual,
Mr. President.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:05.930
Actually, sales are so good
we've run out of diamonds.

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:09.700
I see. Then it's about time
to hold another event.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.980
Ahem. Thank you for coming today.

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:20.200
As thanks for your patronage, we'll raffle
invitations to an even better deal,

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:23.490
our All-You-Can-Dig
Diamond Mine Gemstone Tour!

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:25.080
Diamond mine?!

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:26.830
All-You-Can-Dig Gemstone Tour?!

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:28.370
-I'll go!
-I want to go!

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:29.390
I'll go!

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:36.500
Sir, what's the
All-You-Can-Dig Gemstone Tour like?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:40.550
Mr. President never takes
any other employees on the tour.

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:43.200
Nobody knows the details.

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:47.740
I admire all of your love for diamonds.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.600
Forget that!

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:53.020
When are we going to reach
the gemstone digging site?

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.790
Just a little further.

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:57.900
Here it is.

00:08:57.900 --> 00:08:59.280
Huh? Where is this?

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:02.030
-What's going on?
-There's no diamonds here!

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:05.880
Where are the diamond gemstones
supposed to be?!

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:09.870
The diamond gemstones are all of you!

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:11.970
What's he talking about?

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:34.140
What is this thing?!

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:36.640
What do you mean "this thing", you fool!

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.280
WANYUDO

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:57.980
Well, well.
Let's see how today's diamonds look.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:02.010
Ah, splendid, splendid.

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:05.930
The customers' glaring eyes
make for a superb shine.

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:07.800
They must be satisfied.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:13.480
They were able to become the diamonds
that they desired so much.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.640
You said it.

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:19.020
But, you know, I'm really glad
I met you, Wanyudo.

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.190
Indeed.

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:25.240
I wish to consume human souls.
You wish to obtain diamonds.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.950
We are two cogs meant to fit together.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.390
The perfect partners.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:34.140
Unlike with him...

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:40.460
Kitaro, please.

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:43.550
Kitaro!

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:45.230
Oh, right, Dad.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.720
Did you hear?

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:55.930
Everyone going on the BiBiBi Carat Diamond
All-You-Can-Dig Gemstone Tour

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:58.660
has been disappearing one after another.

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:02.790
Yeah. According to rumors, they all...

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:05.400
"Oh wow.

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:05.340
PRESIDENT'S OFFICE

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:08.300
Diamond gemstones are so profitable!!!

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:13.330
Starting today
I'm living carefree overseas!"

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:14.850
And, send.

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:19.410
Apparently they hire maids
and live in the lap of luxury.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:33.430
Human greed never ceases to amaze.

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:38.930
But, thanks to that,
I can fill my belly with souls like this.

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:43.020
Thank goodness for greed, seriously.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:44.070
In reality,

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:48.570
they don't have any idea what these stones
that you can't even eat are worth.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:53.490
They get swept away by other people
telling them these things are good

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.970
and don't even question if it's true.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:12:02.330
In the end, they just help spread
fake information, the suckers.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:05.340
This wine costs a million yen a bottle,

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:09.380
but how many people
really understand its taste?

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:11.780
Not like I understand it either.

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:21.580
In the end, it's just
a raw ingredient of pee.

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.380
You're coming with us.

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:36.160
<i>YOKAI</i> WANYUDO

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:40.660
DIAMOND <i>YOKAI</i> AND KITARO

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:39.600
<i>-"I sense </i>yokai<i> activity."</i>
<i>-"What'd I do?"</i>

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:40.600
<i>"I didn't see that..."</i>

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:44.880
This world is made up of
an infinite number of cogs.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:47.750
They all fit together
in an orderly and delicate fashion.

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:51.320
As a result, the planet
continues to spin in peace.

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:56.160
You people are...?

00:12:56.680 --> 00:13:03.430
But, if even one faulty cog is in the mix,
the planet stops.

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:10.110
The control of distribution, pricing,
and production of diamonds on this planet

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:14.320
is done by us,
the One World Adamas Syndicate.

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:18.410
However, because of the super cheap
business you started,

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:24.390
the international diamond trading price
is facing a potential massive decline.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:28.560
But if we make them cheap,
people buy them and we can make a profit!

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:33.470
Diamonds are unobtainable.
That's what makes them diamonds.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:37.180
Diamonds of such quality,
and in such abundance...

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:41.200
We'd like you to share with us
where you get them.

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:44.480
It's in this cave.

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.670
I-It's right here.

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:51.020
The tour members have arrived!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:57.400
What is this?!

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:00.910
Hold on a second! What is this?

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:03.910
You're kidding me! I don't want--

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:08.000
Why you!

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.710
Make the thing stop, dammit!
I'll kill you!

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:12.820
Stop! Stop, stop, stop!

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:17.430
It's of amazing quality!

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:19.510
So this is your trick...

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:21.050
Well, er, um...

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:23.310
Listen! If you value your life--

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:24.640
Right, I'll stop produc--

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:25.850
Keep making them!

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:26.710
Huh?

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:29.570
We'll mass produce diamonds in this cave,

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:34.110
and distribute them to the world while
strictly controlling the trading value.

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:36.030
Th-The world?

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:41.740
I don't think it's possible to get enough
tour customers to make that many diamonds.

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:46.830
Miners we have digging in mines,
children in poverty sold by their parents,

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:50.210
refugees escaping from
various civil wars...

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:54.340
There are more than enough people
in the world to use as raw materials.

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:58.010
Rather than mining gemstones,
it'd be much cheaper to get diamonds

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:03.140
by stuffing those people in containers
and bringing them to this country.

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:07.640
I don't know.
That may be going a bit far...

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:12.020
Are you saying I can eat even more souls
than I am now?

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:13.440
-Huh?
-Precisely.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.400
Huh?!

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:17.910
Very well. Keep bringing me humans!

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:19.530
Hey! What are you--

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.910
It's a deal.

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:22.410
What?!

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:25.910
<i>Things are going in a weird direction...</i>

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:45.740
Heave-ho.

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:58.260
How many of you do you think
that one bullet is worth?!

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:14.880
The more I eat, the more I want more...

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:16.460
Bring me even more!

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:34.210
Greed is a scary thing, huh, Wanyudo?

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:38.280
Forget that!
Haven't the next humans arrived yet?!

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:40.610
I am hungry!

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:41.780
Huh?

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:45.030
You just turned people to diamonds
and ate their souls.

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:47.950
It's not nearly enough! More, more!

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:50.890
I can feel my stomach
pressing against my back!

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:59.040
What the hell?!
I left that guy to do heavy labor!

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:04.680
Silence! Stop complaining
and bring me more humans!

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:08.300
Otherwise I'll consume your soul!

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:11.910
<i>Things are getting out of hand.</i>

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:15.710
<i>I should call Kitaro
and have him eliminate this guy.</i>

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:20.440
<i>No, I cut ties with him.
I can't ask him now.</i>

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:24.550
<i>Besides, even if I ask him,
he'd never come...</i>

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:28.450
<i>I'm Mana.</i>

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:33.710
<i>I was kidnapped by an evil </i>yokai
<i>and trapped in a mountain cave.</i>

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:37.020
<i>Please come and help me
right away, Kitaro!</i>

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:40.570
Huh? But Mana just sent me...

00:17:41.230 --> 00:17:44.510
<i>Cat-san, a cake store just opened
on 3rd Street!</i>

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:47.470
<i>As an opening special
Mont Blancs are half off!</i>

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:50.810
Huh? Then this letter is...

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:53.560
Only one person would do this.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:54.980
Rat Man.

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:58.980
But he said he was cutting ties
with you, Kitaro, didn't he?

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:02.610
I know. I bet
he's in some helpless situation,

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:05.740
so he's pretending to be Mana
to get you to save him.

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:08.370
What a hopeless case.

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.430
There's no need to go, Kitaro.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:15.140
S-Stop! Calm down, please calm down!

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:19.020
N-Nakamura!

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:23.420
Nakamura was...!

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:27.390
When are the additional humans coming?!
Satisfy my stomach!

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:31.390
The seas are rough and the boats are late!
If you wait a little longer...

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:34.580
I'm hungry right here, right now!

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:47.530
My soul will just upset your stomach!

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:49.780
Satisfy me!

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:55.240
Kitaro?!

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:57.750
So that letter really was...

00:18:57.750 --> 00:19:00.290
Letter? Wh-What are you talking about?

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:03.500
We cut ties.
I'd never send a letter to you.

00:19:05.360 --> 00:19:07.530
Wait... You knew and yet you...?

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.140
Why?

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:13.890
I came to rescue Mana, but the guy
I cut ties with happened to be here.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:15.830
Kitaro...

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:25.740
So you're GeGeGe no Kitaro! Perfect!

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:31.490
A soul like yours will surely satisfy
this stomach of mine!

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:32.700
Get out of here!

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:33.740
But...

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.430
You'll get in the way!

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:40.100
Hair Needles!

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:51.820
Finger Guns!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:03.520
I cut ties with him.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:05.630
Whatever happens isn't my concern...

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.280
But...

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:10.990
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:21.710
Oh no!

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:32.050
Fill my stomach with your soul!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.300
Kitaro!

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:44.310
Rat Man?!

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:50.340
I can't let you
hog all the glory after all...

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:56.950
I'm hungry, Kitaro!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.080
Take this!

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:32.920
Are you okay?

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:35.320
You took care of it...

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:37.820
You know, Kitaro...

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:39.200
Huh?

00:21:40.390 --> 00:21:42.950
I'm through with diamonds.

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:54.890
And so, I thought I'd start up
a new cryptocurrency, BiBiBit Coin!

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:56.720
You're in, right, Kitaro?!

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:59.140
-Not interested.
-You hippo.

00:21:59.140 --> 00:22:02.520
I'm not a hippo, I'm a rat!
And after I was nice enough to invite you!

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:04.830
Kitaro! Hey!

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.470
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.470
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.930
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.930
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.190
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.190
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:34.990
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:34.990
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:40.950
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:40.950
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.300
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.300
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:09.060
<i>Captivated by the Dream World,
adults aren't waking up.</i>

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:10.480
<i>Even Catchick...</i>

00:23:10.600 --> 00:23:12.560
<i>Dad?!</i>

00:23:12.690 --> 00:23:14.530
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:14.650 --> 00:23:17.070
<i>"Makura-Gaeshi and the Fantastic Dream"</i>

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:19.740
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
